2. **`category`**: Embeddings can capture the similarities between different clothing categories.
3. **`username`**: While not inherently semantically rich, embeddings could help analyze user behavior and preferences.
4. **`role`**: Different roles can be semantically represented to understand user interactions better.
5. **`preferred_sizes`**: Embeddings can help in understanding user preferences across different sizes.
6. **`region`**: Embeddings can capture regional similarities and differences in size preferences and return rates.

